    {
      "text": "It has the power in its clawed arms to make scrap of a car. The tips of its claws release poison.",
      "version": "alpha-sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "Its poison is potent, but it rarely sees use. This Pokémon prefers to use physical force instead, going on rampages with its car-crushing strength.",
      "version": "sword"
    },
    {
      "text": "It’s so vicious that it’s called the Sand Demon. Yet when confronted by Hippowdon, Drapion keeps a low profile and will never pick a fight.",
      "version": "shield"
    },
    {
      "text": "Has a brutish, ferocious temperament. With immense strength and a sturdy shell off which swords will bounce, it rampages about and wreaks havoc.",
      "version": "legends-arceus"
    }
  ],
